    {
      "section": "1.5.5",
      "label": "",
      "text": "The DMS shall, on an as-needed basis, determine from appropriate calibration data what fraction of the signal detected in any given ampliﬁer on each sensor in the focal plane appears in any other ampliﬁer, and shall record that fraction in a correction matrix.",
